      221  ==Culture==
      222  [[File:Lipcani, r-n Briceni, Republica Moldova St Katherine Church, Lipcani, Briceni Region, Republic of Moldova (50951726452).jpg|thumb|Church in [[Lipcani]]]]
      223  The district operates 31 houses and homes of culture, 32 public libraries, five schools of arts education, which includes 154 employees.
      224  Most houses, libraries, art schools have a good basic material, cultural institutions headquarters remain in an exemplary cleaning. Most cultural events are organized by the homes of culture, library and music school in the village of [[Larga, Briceni|Larga]], the homes of culture in the villages [[
      226  Vocal-instrumental ensemble "Amor" village festival Drepcăuți became laureate of contest "harmonies fall."
      227  Recently, the folk dance team "Marinca" from the village participated in international festival Larga choreography "Vesennie arabeski" held in the [[Luhansk Oblast]], Ukraine, where he won the title of [[laureate]] of the prestigious international festival.
      228  In district 28 artistic groups working with the honorary title "model".
